NOTICE — tsps-go
================

This project is a Go port of the server component of TSPS
(https://github.com/RSPSApp/tsps), a TypeScript Old School RuneScape
private server, at commit bfd81e3abf8ee758c3ae29cd4127ae088242d71b
("Merge pull request #5193"). The upstream project is distributed
under the BSD 2-Clause License; the full license text, including its
copyright notice (Copyright (c) 2022-2026, dennisdev, xrsps), is
preserved verbatim in the LICENSE file in this repository. This port
is distributed under the same license.

Upstream credits, as listed in the upstream README:

  We want to thank Astrul/@Lerl, Detuks/@Reinismu,
  Kraken/@UnhealthyKraken, Vexus/@Bandit-HaxUnit, @xrsps and all the
  contributors of both the legacy Java project and the TypeScript
  continuation.

The upstream server is the official continuation of the Elvarg fork
(RSPSApp/elvarg-rsps), ported to TypeScript; the upstream browser
client was forked from xrsps/xrsps-typescript. This Go port covers
the server only and keeps the existing TypeScript client.

This fan project is not affiliated with Jagex Ltd. Old School
RuneScape and related assets and trademarks belong to their
respective owners.

Cache data is never bundled with this project. The game cache must be
obtained at runtime from the OpenRS2 archive
(https://archive.openrs2.org), using the same download-at-deploy-time
approach as the upstream server (see internal/cache). No cache
binaries are redistributed by this repository.
